 ["Brings Blizzard's native gamepad interface alive under your thumbs:\n• |cffffffffRadial & Menus:|r Soft tactile micro-taps as your stick moves across buttons and tabs.\n• |cffffffffWindows:|r Physical confirmation when opening bags, merchant shops, banks, and mail.\n• |cffffffffDialogs & Prompts:|r Tactile prompt when NPC interaction windows or quest frames appear."] = "Brings Blizzard's native gamepad interface alive under your thumbs:\n• |cffffffffRadial & Menus:|r Soft tactile micro-taps as your stick moves across buttons and tabs.\n• |cffffffffWindows:|r Physical confirmation when opening bags, merchant shops, banks, and mail.\n• |cffffffffDialogs & Prompts:|r Tactile prompt when NPC interaction windows or quest frames appear.",
