 ["Master switch for all menu, window, tab, and radial controller haptics. Turn off to silence all UI navigation haptics at once while keeping combat and world rumble active."] = "Master switch for all menu, window, tab, and radial controller haptics. Turn off to silence all UI navigation haptics at once while keeping combat and world rumble active.",
