 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive to eliminate execution taint when targeting stops or gamepad mode is toggled."] = "Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive to eliminate execution taint when targeting stops or gamepad mode is toggled.",
 ["Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive. Fires when the group targeting modifier is released."] = "Passively polled via GroupTargeting.isTargetingActive. Fires when the group targeting modifier is released.",
