 ["Polled from StaticPopup1..4's IsShown() four times a second rather than hooked. StaticPopup_Show is called from all over Blizzard's UI by code that then touches protected frames, and this addon already has one taint incident from exactly that shape (Modules/ControllerUI.lua's ActivateRadial note). Untested."] = "Polled from StaticPopup1..4's IsShown() four times a second rather than hooked. StaticPopup_Show is called from all over Blizzard's UI by code that then touches protected frames, and this addon already has one taint incident from exactly that shape (Modules/ControllerUI.lua's ActivateRadial note). Untested.",
 ["Presence floor (low)"] = "Presence floor (low)",
 ["Present whether or not you are moving, and it does not read your speed at all, so it keeps working while speed comes back as a secret value. Drives the SLOW motor, whose large mass is what buoyancy actually feels like, leaving the sharp one to \"Swimming resistance\" — so the two never collide. Floating gives you this alone."] = "Present whether or not you are moving, and it does not read your speed at all, so it keeps working while speed comes back as a secret value. Drives the SLOW motor, whose large mass is what buoyancy actually feels like, leaving the sharp one to \"Swimming resistance\" — so the two never collide. Floating gives you this alone.",
 ["Priest"] = "Priest",
