 ["Produces no vibration — the controller is gone. Turning it off changes nothing you can feel: the engine clears in-flight vibration whenever it loses the device, because it has to."] = "Produces no vibration — the controller is gone. Turning it off changes nothing you can feel: the engine clears in-flight vibration whenever it loses the device, because it has to.",
