 ["Same fall-duration proxy as \"Landed\", just a higher threshold and a heavier mode."] = "Same fall-duration proxy as \"Landed\", just a higher threshold and a heavier mode.",
 ["Same polled mechanism as \"Confirmation popup appeared\". Untested."] = "Same polled mechanism as \"Confirmation popup appeared\". Untested.",
 ["Same source as weaponSwingMain above — PLAYER_SWING, filtered to the OffHand swing type. Silent if you're not dual-wielding. Parry haste has never affected off-hand timing, so that correction does not apply here even on the fallback estimator."] = "Same source as weaponSwingMain above — PLAYER_SWING, filtered to the OffHand swing type. Silent if you're not dual-wielding. Parry haste has never affected off-hand timing, so that correction does not apply here even on the fallback estimator.",
 ["Same weight and shape as the vendor, mailbox and bank cues alongside it — all four are \"a window you walked up to has opened\", and they deliberately feel alike rather than each inventing a signature."] = "Same weight and shape as the vendor, mailbox and bank cues alongside it — all four are \"a window you walked up to has opened\", and they deliberately feel alike rather than each inventing a signature.",
 ["Sandstorm / Gale intensity"] = "Sandstorm / Gale intensity",
