 ["The experimental section"] = "The experimental section",
 ["The fallback for any character with no rule of its own — including characters you have not logged into yet. Set this to the profile you mostly want, then override the handful of characters that differ."] = "The fallback for any character with no rule of its own — including characters you have not logged into yet. Set this to the profile you mostly want, then override the handful of characters that differ.",
