 ["World of Warcraft ignores controllers entirely until you turn them on, and this is off by default. Pairing the controller to your computer is not enough — the game has to be told separately.\n\nType this into chat, then restart the game:\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\nUntil that is done nothing here can work, and nothing will warn you. If Pulse seems completely dead, check this first."] = "World of Warcraft ignores controllers entirely until you turn them on, and this is off by default. Pairing the controller to your computer is not enough — the game has to be told separately.\n\nType this into chat, then restart the game:\n\n    /console GamePadEnable 1\n\nUntil that is done nothing here can work, and nothing will warn you. If Pulse seems completely dead, check this first.",
